cht)","orig":"scenes/yujitodohanami/lines/57.mp3"},{"t":223.733,"end":226.116,"chars":[2],"who":"Hanami","text":"Domain Ex-","de":"Domain Ex-","orig":"scenes/yujitodohanami/lines/58.mp3"},{"t":228.6,"end":229.8,"chars":[0],"who":"Yuji","text":"(Noises)","de":"(Geräusche)","orig":"scenes/yujitodohanami/lines/59.mp3"},{"t":229.517,"end":234.3,"chars":[3],"who":"Juzo","text":"If it isn't my slick new coat rack floating right up there?","de":"Ist das nicht mein schicker neuer Garderobenständer da oben?","orig":"scenes/yujitodohanami/lines/60.mp3"},{"t":237.55,"end":241.4,"chars":[4],"who":"Gojo","text":"So... where should I start?","de":"Also... wo fang ich an?","orig":"scenes/yujitodohanami/lines/61.mp3"},{"t":242.233,"end":245.616,"chars":[0],"who":"Yuji","text":"Huh? Gojo, is that you?","de":"Hä? Gojo, bist du das?","orig":"scenes/yujitodohanami/lines/62.mp3"},{"t":248.283,"end":256.25,"chars":[4],"who":"Gojo","text":"Yuji's on a much higher level than he was before. Which means my priority should be...","de":"Yuji ist auf einem viel höheren Level als vorher. Das heißt, meine Priorität sollte sein...","orig":"scenes/yujitodohanami/lines/63.mp3"},{"t":261.45,"end":263.683,"chars":[3],"who":"Juzo","text":"(Noises of pain)","de":"(Schmerzenslaute)","orig":"scenes/yujitodohanami/lines/64.mp3"},{"t":263.867,"end":270.1,"chars":[4],"who":"Gojo","text":"Technique Amplification: Blue. Technique Reversal: Red.","de":"Technik-Verstärkung: Blau. Technik-Umkehr: Rot.","orig":"scenes/yujitodohanami/lines/65.mp3"},{"t":273.35,"end":275.55,"chars":[4],"who":"Gojo","text":"Hollow...","de":"Hollow...","orig":"scenes/yujitodohanami/lines/66.mp3"},{"t":279.333,"end":282.283,"chars":[2],"who":"Hanami","text":"(Noises of Pain)","de":"(Schmerzenslaute)","orig":"scenes/yujitodohanami/lines/67.mp3"},{"t":283.433,"end":285.05,"chars":[0],"who":"Yuji","text":"(Gasp)","de":"(keucht)","orig":"scenes/yujitodohanami/lines/68.mp3"},{"t":289.4,"end":290.6,"chars":[1],"who":"Todo","text":"(Noise)","